          "id": 34,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Bombardier employs over 3,000 people in the US and works with roughly 2,800 American companies across 47 states.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Times of India",
          "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-takes-trade-war-with-canada-to-ice/articleshow/133933622.cms",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Canadian Prime Minister Mark Carney noted that Canada is the largest customer for US goods in 26 states.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Times of India",
          "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-takes-trade-war-with-canada-to-ice/articleshow/133933622.cms",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Canadian Prime Minister Mark Carney stated in a video address that Canada's trade pivot away from the US will come at a cost but is necessary to protect Canadian workers.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c8jdev0422jo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Canada's counter-tariffs ranging from 15% to 50% came into force on Tuesday, targeting nearly C$28 billion ($20 billion) worth of American goods.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c8jdev0422jo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "The US maintains a 25% tariff on Canadian cars, trucks, steel, aluminium, and lumber, alongside 50% tariffs imposed in late August on Canadian dairy, alcohol, hockey sticks, and perfume.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c8jdev0422jo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Canada lost roughly 41,000 jobs in August following the collapse of trade negotiations and new US tariffs.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c8jdev0422jo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Canada's retaliatory tariffs of up to 50% on around $20 billion of US goods went into effect at midnight on Tuesday.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "NPR World",
          "url": "https://www.npr.org/2026/09/08/g-s1-142302/up-first-newsletter-trumpapalooza-amazon-cargo-plane-crash-canada-tariffs",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "The Gordie Howe International Bridge connecting Detroit, Michigan and Windsor, Ontario opened recently without US officials attending the event.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "DW World",
          "url": "https://www.dw.com/en/us-canada-tariff-dispute-weighs-on-cross-border-ties/a-78815803?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "The Financial Accountability Office of Ontario estimated the new tariff regime will cost 119,000 local jobs in Ontario in 2026.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "DW World",
          "url": "https://www.dw.com/en/us-canada-tariff-dispute-weighs-on-cross-border-ties/a-78815803?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "cluster_id": 2,
